sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant UAS as UserActivityService
    participant Buffer as Activity Buffer
    participant EventBus
    participant Cache
    participant DB as Database
    participant Audit

    Note over Client,Audit: Activity Logging Flow (High-Throughput)

    Client->>API: User Action (e.g., view content)
    API->>UAS: logActivity(userId, type, metadata)

    UAS->>UAS: Create ActivityEvent
    UAS->>UAS: Parse device from user agent
    UAS->>Buffer: Add to buffer

    alt Buffer is full
        UAS->>DB: Batch INSERT (1000 activities)
        DB-->>UAS: Success
    end

    UAS->>EventBus: Publish activity event
    EventBus-->>UAS: Event published

    UAS->>Cache: Increment activity counter
    Cache-->>UAS: Counter updated

    opt Session provided
        UAS->>Cache: Get session
        Cache-->>UAS: Session data
        UAS->>Cache: Update session activity
    end

    UAS-->>API: ActivityEvent
    API-->>Client: Success

    Note over Buffer,DB: Periodic Flush (every 5 seconds)

    loop Every 5 seconds
        Buffer->>DB: Flush buffered activities
        DB-->>Buffer: Batch inserted
    end

    Note over Client,Audit: Session Management Flow

    Client->>API: Login request
    API->>UAS: createSession(userId, metadata)

    UAS->>UAS: Generate session ID
    UAS->>Cache: Store session (30min TTL)
    UAS->>DB: Persist session
    UAS->>UAS: logActivity(SESSION_CREATED)

    UAS-->>API: UserSession
    API-->>Client: Session created

    Note over Client,Audit: Statistics Query Flow

    Client->>API: GET /activities/stats
    API->>UAS: getActivityStats(startDate, endDate)

    UAS->>Cache: Check cache

    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>UAS: Cached stats
    else Cache miss
        UAS->>DB: Query activities
        UAS->>DB: Query sessions
        UAS->>DB: Aggregate data
        DB-->>UAS: Raw data
        UAS->>UAS: Calculate statistics
        UAS->>Cache: Store stats (1h TTL)
    end

    UAS-->>API: ActivityStats
    API-->>Client: Statistics response

    Note over Client,Audit: Suspicious Activity Detection

    Client->>API: Multiple failed logins
    API->>UAS: logActivity(FAILED_LOGIN)
    UAS->>UAS: Increment failure counter

    API->>UAS: detectSuspiciousActivity(userId)
    UAS->>DB: Query recent activities
    DB-->>UAS: Activity history

    UAS->>UAS: Analyze patterns
    UAS->>UAS: Calculate confidence score

    alt Suspicious detected
        UAS->>Audit: Log security alert
        UAS->>EventBus: Publish security event
    end

    UAS-->>API: SuspiciousActivityResult
    API-->>Client: Alert/Block response

    Note over Client,Audit: Privacy & GDPR Compliance

    Client->>API: Request data export
    API->>UAS: exportUserActivity(request)

    UAS->>DB: Query all user activities
    DB-->>UAS: Activity records

    UAS->>UAS: Format as JSON/CSV
    UAS->>Audit: Log export action

    UAS-->>API: ActivityExportResult
    API-->>Client: Download data

    Client->>API: Request data deletion
    API->>UAS: deleteActivities(userId, beforeDate)

    UAS->>DB: DELETE activities
    DB-->>UAS: Rows deleted

    UAS->>Audit: Log deletion
    UAS-->>API: Deletion count
    API-->>Client: Confirmation
